    "title": "Wheezys to host fundraiser for man in need of liver transplant - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dillon Fuhrman ,\n8 hours ago YUMA, Ariz. (KYMA) - Wheezys Restaurant & Sports Bar is hosting a fundraiser for a man in need of a liver transplant.\nShawn's Takeover is taking place at the restaurant, located 11732 S. Fortuna Road, Tuesday, August 4, at 4 p.m.\nThis is to raise funds for a man named Shawn who is in need of a liver transplant, and the fundraiser is said to \"ease the burden of medical bills and recovery expense.\"\nDuring the fundraiser, there will be raffles, a 50/50 drawing and a silent auction.\nThose who attend the fundraiser must present the flyer or a picture of the flyer to their server when ordering food.\nThe fundraiser will go until 7 p.m.\nThe post Wheezys to host fundraiser for man in need of liver transplant appeared first on KYMA .",
    "summary": "8 hours ago YUMA, Ariz. (KYMA) - Wheezys Restaurant & Sports Bar is hosting a fundraiser for a man in need of a liver transplant. Shawn's Takeover is taking place at the restaurant, located 11732 S. Fortuna Road, Tuesday, August 4, at 4 p.m. This is to raise funds for a man named Shawn who is in need of a liver transplant, and the fundraiser is said to \"ease the burden of medical bills and recovery expense.\" During the fundraiser, there will be raffles, a 50/50 drawing and a silent auction.",
